dho:p-sn46.51-22.2 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.51 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.51:22.2" ;
    dho:textEn "There is tranquility of the body and of the mind."@en ;
    dho:textPi "Atthi, bhikkhave, kāyappassaddhi cittappassaddhi."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.51/en/sujato#sn46.51:22.2"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.51-22.3 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.51 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.51:22.3" ;
    dho:textEn "Not frequently applying the mind to that"@en ;
    dho:textPi "Tattha amanasikārabahulīkāro—"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.51/en/sujato#sn46.51:22.3"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.51-22.4 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.51 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.51:22.4" ;
    dho:textEn "starves the arising of the awakening factor of tranquility, or, when it has arisen, starves its full development."@en ;
    dho:textPi "ayamanāhāro anuppannassa vā passaddhisambojjhaṅgassa uppādāya, uppannassa vā passaddhisambojjhaṅgassa bhāvanāya pāripūriyā."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.51/en/sujato#sn46.51:22.4"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.51-23.2 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.51 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.51:23.2" ;
    dho:textEn "There are things that are the basis of serenity and freedom from distraction."@en ;
    dho:textPi "Atthi, bhikkhave, samathanimittaṁ abyagganimittaṁ."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.51/en/sujato#sn46.51:23.2"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.51-23.3 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.51 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.51:23.3" ;
    dho:textEn "Not frequently applying the mind to that"@en ;
    dho:textPi "Tattha amanasikārabahulīkāro—"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.51/en/sujato#sn46.51:23.3"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.51-23.4 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.51 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.51:23.4" ;
    dho:textEn "starves the arising of the awakening factor of immersion, or, when it has arisen, starves its full development."@en ;
    dho:textPi "ayamanāhāro anuppannassa vā samādhisambojjhaṅgassa uppādāya, uppannassa vā samādhisambojjhaṅgassa bhāvanāya pāripūriyā."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.51/en/sujato#sn46.51:23.4"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.51-24.2 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.51 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.51:24.2" ;
    dho:textEn "There are things that are grounds for the awakening factor of equanimity."@en ;
    dho:textPi "Atthi, bhikkhave, upekkhāsambojjhaṅgaṭṭhānīyā dhammā."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.51/en/sujato#sn46.51:24.2"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.51-24.3 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.51 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.51:24.3" ;
    dho:textEn "Not frequently applying the mind to that"@en ;
    dho:textPi "Tattha amanasikārabahulīkāro—"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.51/en/sujato#sn46.51:24.3"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.51-24.4 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.51 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.51:24.4" ;
    dho:textEn "starves the arising of the awakening factor of equanimity, or, when it has arisen, starves its full development.”"@en ;
    dho:textPi "ayamanāhāro anuppannassa vā upekkhāsambojjhaṅgassa uppādāya, uppannassa vā upekkhāsambojjhaṅgassa bhāvanāya pāripūriyā”ti."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.51/en/sujato#sn46.51:24.4"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.51-3.1 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.51 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.51:3.1" ;
    dho:textEn "And what fuels the arising of dullness and drowsiness, or, when they have arisen, makes them increase and grow?"@en ;
    dho:textPi "Ko ca, bhikkhave, āhāro anuppannassa vā thinamiddhassa uppādāya, uppannassa vā thinamiddhassa bhiyyobhāvāya vepullāya?"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.51/en/sujato#sn46.51:3.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.51-3.2 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.51 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.51:3.2" ;
    dho:textEn "There is discontent, sloth, yawning, sleepiness after eating, and mental sluggishness."@en ;
    dho:textPi "Atthi, bhikkhave, arati tandi vijambhitā bhattasammado cetaso ca līnattaṁ."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.51/en/sujato#sn46.51:3.2"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.51-3.3 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.51 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.51:3.3" ;
    dho:textEn "Frequent irrational application of mind to that"@en ;
    dho:textPi "Tattha ayonisomanasikārabahulīkāro—"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.51/en/sujato#sn46.51:3.3"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.51-3.4 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.51 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.51:3.4" ;
    dho:textEn "fuels the arising of dullness and drowsiness, or, when they have arisen, makes them increase and grow."@en ;
    dho:textPi "ayamāhāro anuppannassa vā thinamiddhassa uppādāya, uppannassa vā thinamiddhassa bhiyyobhāvāya vepullāya."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.51/en/sujato#sn46.51:3.4"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.51-4.1 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.51 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.51:4.1" ;
    dho:textEn "And what fuels the arising of restlessness and remorse, or, when they have arisen, makes them increase and grow?"@en ;
    dho:textPi "Ko ca, bhikkhave, āhāro anuppannassa vā uddhaccakukkuccassa uppādāya, uppannassa vā uddhaccakukkuccassa bhiyyobhāvāya vepullāya?"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.51/en/sujato#sn46.51:4.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.51-4.2 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.51 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.51:4.2" ;
    dho:textEn "There is the unsettled mind."@en ;
    dho:textPi "Atthi, bhikkhave, cetaso avūpasamo."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.51/en/sujato#sn46.51:4.2"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.51-4.3 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.51 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.51:4.3" ;
    dho:textEn "Frequent irrational application of mind to that"@en ;
    dho:textPi "Tattha ayonisomanasikārabahulīkāro—"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.51/en/sujato#sn46.51:4.3"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.51-4.4 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.51 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.51:4.4" ;
    dho:textEn "fuels the arising of restlessness and remorse, or, when they have arisen, makes them increase and grow."@en ;
    dho:textPi "ayamāhāro anuppannassa vā uddhaccakukkuccassa uppādāya, uppannassa vā uddhaccakukkuccassa bhiyyobhāvāya vepullāya."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.51/en/sujato#sn46.51:4.4"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.51-5.1 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.51 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.51:5.1" ;
    dho:textEn "And what fuels the arising of doubt, or, when it has arisen, makes it increase and grow?"@en ;
    dho:textPi "Ko ca, bhikkhave, āhāro anuppannāya vā vicikicchāya uppādāya, uppannāya vā vicikicchāya bhiyyobhāvāya vepullāya?"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.51/en/sujato#sn46.51:5.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.51-5.2 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.51 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.51:5.2" ;
    dho:textEn "There are things that are grounds for doubt."@en ;
    dho:textPi "Atthi, bhikkhave, vicikicchāṭṭhānīyā dhammā."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.51/en/sujato#sn46.51:5.2"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.51-5.3 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.51 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.51:5.3" ;
    dho:textEn "Frequent irrational application of mind to them"@en ;
    dho:textPi "Tattha ayonisomanasikārabahulīkāro—"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.51/en/sujato#sn46.51:5.3"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.51-5.4 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.51 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.51:5.4" ;
    dho:textEn "fuels the arising of doubt, or, when it has arisen, makes it increase and grow."@en ;
    dho:textPi "ayamāhāro anuppannāya vā vicikicchāya uppādāya, uppannāya vā vicikicchāya bhiyyobhāvāya vepullāya."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.51/en/sujato#sn46.51:5.4"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.51-6.1 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.51 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.51:6.1" ;
    dho:textEn "And what fuels the arising of the awakening factor of mindfulness, or, when it has arisen, fully develops it?"@en ;
    dho:textPi "Ko ca, bhikkhave, āhāro anuppannassa vā satisambojjhaṅgassa uppādāya, uppannassa vā satisambojjhaṅgassa bhāvanāya pāripūriyā?"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.51/en/sujato#sn46.51:6.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

