dho:p-sn46.52-10.2 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.52 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.52:10.2" ;
    dho:textEn "Mindfulness of internal things is the awakening factor of mindfulness; and mindfulness of external things is also the awakening factor of mindfulness."@en ;
    dho:textPi "Yadapi, bhikkhave, ajjhattaṁ dhammesu sati tadapi satisambojjhaṅgo, yadapi bahiddhā dhammesu sati tadapi satisambojjhaṅgo."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.52/en/sujato#sn46.52:10.2"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.52-10.3 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.52 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.52:10.3" ;
    dho:textEn "That’s how what is concisely referred to as ‘the awakening factor of mindfulness’ becomes twofold."@en ;
    dho:textPi "‘Satisambojjhaṅgo’ti iti hidaṁ uddesaṁ gacchati. Tadamināpetaṁ pariyāyena dvayaṁ hoti."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.52/en/sujato#sn46.52:10.3"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.52-11.1 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.52 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.52:11.1" ;
    dho:textEn "Investigating, exploring, and inquiring into internal things with wisdom is the awakening factor of investigation of principles; and investigating, exploring, and inquiring into external things with wisdom is also the awakening factor of investigation of principles."@en ;
    dho:textPi "Yadapi, bhikkhave, ajjhattaṁ dhammesu paññāya pavicinati pavicarati parivīmaṁsamāpajjati tadapi dhammavicayasambojjhaṅgo, yadapi bahiddhā dhammesu paññāya pavicinati pavicarati parivīmaṁsamāpajjati tadapi dhammavicayasambojjhaṅgo."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.52/en/sujato#sn46.52:11.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.52-11.2 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.52 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.52:11.2" ;
    dho:textEn "That’s how what is concisely referred to as ‘the awakening factor of investigation of principles’ becomes twofold."@en ;
    dho:textPi "‘Dhammavicayasambojjhaṅgo’ti iti hidaṁ uddesaṁ gacchati. Tadamināpetaṁ pariyāyena dvayaṁ hoti."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.52/en/sujato#sn46.52:11.2"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.52-12.1 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.52 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.52:12.1" ;
    dho:textEn "Physical energy is the awakening factor of energy; and mental energy is also the awakening factor of energy."@en ;
    dho:textPi "Yadapi, bhikkhave, kāyikaṁ vīriyaṁ tadapi vīriyasambojjhaṅgo, yadapi cetasikaṁ vīriyaṁ tadapi vīriyasambojjhaṅgo."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.52/en/sujato#sn46.52:12.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.52-12.2 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.52 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.52:12.2" ;
    dho:textEn "That’s how what is concisely referred to as ‘the awakening factor of energy’ becomes twofold."@en ;
    dho:textPi "‘Vīriyasambojjhaṅgo’ti iti hidaṁ uddesaṁ gacchati. Tadamināpetaṁ pariyāyena dvayaṁ hoti."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.52/en/sujato#sn46.52:12.2"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.52-13.1 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.52 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.52:13.1" ;
    dho:textEn "Rapture while placing the mind and keeping it connected is the awakening factor of rapture; and rapture without placing the mind and keeping it connected is also the awakening factor of rapture."@en ;
    dho:textPi "Yadapi, bhikkhave, savitakkasavicārā pīti tadapi pītisambojjhaṅgo, yadapi avitakkaavicārā pīti tadapi pītisambojjhaṅgo."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.52/en/sujato#sn46.52:13.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.52-13.2 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.52 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.52:13.2" ;
    dho:textEn "In this way what is concisely referred to as ‘the awakening factor of rapture’ becomes twofold."@en ;
    dho:textPi "‘Pītisambojjhaṅgo’ti iti hidaṁ uddesaṁ gacchati. Tadamināpetaṁ pariyāyena dvayaṁ hoti."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.52/en/sujato#sn46.52:13.2"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.52-14.1 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.52 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.52:14.1" ;
    dho:textEn "Physical tranquility is the awakening factor of tranquility; and mental tranquility is also the awakening factor of tranquility."@en ;
    dho:textPi "Yadapi, bhikkhave, kāyappassaddhi tadapi passaddhisambojjhaṅgo, yadapi cittappassaddhi tadapi passaddhisambojjhaṅgo."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.52/en/sujato#sn46.52:14.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.52-14.2 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.52 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.52:14.2" ;
    dho:textEn "In this way what is concisely referred to as ‘the awakening factor of tranquility’ becomes twofold."@en ;
    dho:textPi "‘Passaddhisambojjhaṅgo’ti iti hidaṁ uddesaṁ gacchati. Tadamināpetaṁ pariyāyena dvayaṁ hoti."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.52/en/sujato#sn46.52:14.2"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.52-15.1 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.52 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.52:15.1" ;
    dho:textEn "Immersion while placing the mind and keeping it connected is the awakening factor of immersion; and immersion without placing the mind and keeping it connected is also the awakening factor of immersion."@en ;
    dho:textPi "Yadapi, bhikkhave, savitakko savicāro samādhi tadapi samādhisambojjhaṅgo, yadapi avitakkaavicāro samādhi tadapi samādhisambojjhaṅgo."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.52/en/sujato#sn46.52:15.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.52-15.2 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.52 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.52:15.2" ;
    dho:textEn "In this way what is concisely referred to as ‘the awakening factor of immersion’ becomes twofold."@en ;
    dho:textPi "‘Samādhisambojjhaṅgo’ti iti hidaṁ uddesaṁ gacchati. Tadamināpetaṁ pariyāyena dvayaṁ hoti."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.52/en/sujato#sn46.52:15.2"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.52-16.1 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.52 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.52:16.1" ;
    dho:textEn "Equanimity for internal things is the awakening factor of equanimity; and equanimity for external things is also the awakening factor of equanimity."@en ;
    dho:textPi "Yadapi, bhikkhave, ajjhattaṁ dhammesu upekkhā tadapi upekkhāsambojjhaṅgo, yadapi bahiddhā dhammesu upekkhā tadapi upekkhāsambojjhaṅgo."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.52/en/sujato#sn46.52:16.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.52-16.2 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.52 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.52:16.2" ;
    dho:textEn "In this way what is concisely referred to as ‘the awakening factor of equanimity’ becomes twofold."@en ;
    dho:textPi "‘Upekkhāsambojjhaṅgo’ti iti hidaṁ uddesaṁ gacchati. Tadamināpetaṁ pariyāyena dvayaṁ hoti."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.52/en/sujato#sn46.52:16.2"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.52-9.10 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.52 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.52:9.10" ;
    dho:textEn "Doubt about internal things is a hindrance; and doubt about external things is also a hindrance."@en ;
    dho:textPi "Yadapi, bhikkhave, ajjhattaṁ dhammesu vicikicchā tadapi nīvaraṇaṁ, yadapi bahiddhā dhammesu vicikicchā tadapi nīvaraṇaṁ."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.52/en/sujato#sn46.52:9.10"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.52-9.11 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.52 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.52:9.11" ;
    dho:textEn "That’s how what is concisely referred to as ‘the hindrance of doubt’ becomes twofold."@en ;
    dho:textPi "‘Vicikicchānīvaraṇan’ti iti hidaṁ uddesaṁ gacchati. Tadamināpetaṁ pariyāyena dvayaṁ hoti."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.52/en/sujato#sn46.52:9.11"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.52-9.2 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.52 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.52:9.2" ;
    dho:textEn "Sensual desire for what is internal is a hindrance; and sensual desire for what is external is also a hindrance."@en ;
    dho:textPi "Yadapi, bhikkhave, ajjhattaṁ kāmacchando tadapi nīvaraṇaṁ, yadapi bahiddhā kāmacchando tadapi nīvaraṇaṁ."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.52/en/sujato#sn46.52:9.2"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.52-9.3 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.52 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.52:9.3" ;
    dho:textEn "That’s how what is concisely referred to as ‘the hindrance of sensual desire’ becomes twofold."@en ;
    dho:textPi "‘Kāmacchandanīvaraṇan’ti iti hidaṁ uddesaṁ gacchati. Tadamināpetaṁ pariyāyena dvayaṁ hoti."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.52/en/sujato#sn46.52:9.3"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.52-9.4 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.52 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.52:9.4" ;
    dho:textEn "Ill will for what is internal is a hindrance; and ill will for what is external is also a hindrance."@en ;
    dho:textPi "Yadapi, bhikkhave, ajjhattaṁ byāpādo tadapi nīvaraṇaṁ, yadapi bahiddhā byāpādo tadapi nīvaraṇaṁ."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.52/en/sujato#sn46.52:9.4"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.52-9.5 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.52 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.52:9.5" ;
    dho:textEn "That’s how what is concisely referred to as ‘the hindrance of ill will’ becomes twofold."@en ;
    dho:textPi "‘Byāpādanīvaraṇan’ti iti hidaṁ uddesaṁ gacchati. Tadamināpetaṁ pariyāyena dvayaṁ hoti."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.52/en/sujato#sn46.52:9.5"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.52-9.6 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.52 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.52:9.6" ;
    dho:textEn "Dullness is a hindrance; and drowsiness is also a hindrance."@en ;
    dho:textPi "Yadapi, bhikkhave, thinaṁ tadapi nīvaraṇaṁ, yadapi middhaṁ tadapi nīvaraṇaṁ."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.52/en/sujato#sn46.52:9.6"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.52-9.7 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.52 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.52:9.7" ;
    dho:textEn "That’s how what is concisely referred to as ‘the hindrance of dullness and drowsiness’ becomes twofold."@en ;
    dho:textPi "‘Thinamiddhanīvaraṇan’ti iti hidaṁ uddesaṁ gacchati. Tadamināpetaṁ pariyāyena dvayaṁ hoti."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.52/en/sujato#sn46.52:9.7"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.52-9.8 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.52 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.52:9.8" ;
    dho:textEn "Restlessness is a hindrance; and remorse is also a hindrance."@en ;
    dho:textPi "Yadapi, bhikkhave, uddhaccaṁ tadapi nīvaraṇaṁ, yadapi kukkuccaṁ tadapi nīvaraṇaṁ."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.52/en/sujato#sn46.52:9.8"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.52-9.9 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.52 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.52:9.9" ;
    dho:textEn "That’s how what is concisely referred to as ‘the hindrance of restlessness and remorse’ becomes twofold."@en ;
    dho:textPi "‘Uddhaccakukkuccanīvaraṇan’ti iti hidaṁ uddesaṁ gacchati. Tadamināpetaṁ pariyāyena dvayaṁ hoti."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.52/en/sujato#sn46.52:9.9"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.53-15.4 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.53 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.53:15.4" ;
    dho:textEn "But mindfulness is always useful, I say.”"@en ;
    dho:textPi "Satiñca khvāhaṁ, bhikkhave, sabbatthikaṁ vadāmī”ti."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.53/en/sujato#sn46.53:15.4"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.56-1.10 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.56 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.56:1.10" ;
    dho:textEn "“Prince, there are causes and reasons for not knowing and not seeing."@en ;
    dho:textPi "“Atthi, rājakumāra, hetu, atthi paccayo aññāṇāya adassanāya."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.56/en/sujato#sn46.56:1.10"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.56-1.11 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.56 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.56:1.11" ;
    dho:textEn "Not knowing and not seeing have causes and reasons."@en ;
    dho:textPi "Sahetu, sappaccayo aññāṇaṁ adassanaṁ hoti."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.56/en/sujato#sn46.56:1.11"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.56-1.12 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.56 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.56:1.12" ;
    dho:textEn "There are causes and reasons for knowing and seeing."@en ;
    dho:textPi "Atthi, rājakumāra, hetu, atthi paccayo ñāṇāya dassanāya."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.56/en/sujato#sn46.56:1.12"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.56-1.13 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.56 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.56:1.13" ;
    dho:textEn "Knowing and seeing have causes and reasons.”"@en ;
    dho:textPi "Sahetu, sappaccayo ñāṇaṁ dassanaṁ hotī”ti."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.56/en/sujato#sn46.56:1.13"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.56-2.3 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.56 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.56:2.3" ;
    dho:textEn "“There’s a time when the heart is overcome and mired in sensual desire, without truly knowing and seeing the escape from sensual desire that has arisen."@en ;
    dho:textPi "“Yasmiṁ kho, rājakumāra, samaye kāmarāgapariyuṭṭhitena cetasā viharati kāmarāgaparetena, uppannassa ca kāmarāgassa nissaraṇaṁ yathābhūtaṁ na jānāti na passati—"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.56/en/sujato#sn46.56:2.3"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.56-2.4 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.56 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.56:2.4" ;
    dho:textEn "This is a cause and reason for not knowing and not seeing."@en ;
    dho:textPi "ayampi kho, rājakumāra, hetu, ayaṁ paccayo aññāṇāya adassanāya."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.56/en/sujato#sn46.56:2.4"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.56-3.4 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.56 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.56:3.4" ;
    dho:textEn "doubt, without truly knowing and seeing the escape from doubt that has arisen."@en ;
    dho:textPi "vicikicchāpariyuṭṭhitena cetasā viharati vicikicchāparetena, uppannāya ca vicikicchāya nissaraṇaṁ yathābhūtaṁ na jānāti na passati—"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.56/en/sujato#sn46.56:3.4"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.56-3.5 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.56 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.56:3.5" ;
    dho:textEn "This is a cause and reason for not knowing and not seeing."@en ;
    dho:textPi "ayampi kho, rājakumāra, hetu, ayaṁ paccayo aññāṇāya adassanāya."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.56/en/sujato#sn46.56:3.5"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.56-5.4 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.56 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.56:5.4" ;
    dho:textEn "They truly know and see with a mind that has developed the awakening factor of mindfulness."@en ;
    dho:textPi "So satisambojjhaṅgaṁ bhāvitena cittena yathābhūtaṁ jānāti passati—"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.56/en/sujato#sn46.56:5.4"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.56-5.5 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.56 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.56:5.5" ;
    dho:textEn "This is a cause and reason for knowing and seeing."@en ;
    dho:textPi "ayampi kho, rājakumāra, hetu, ayaṁ paccayo ñāṇāya dassanāya."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.56/en/sujato#sn46.56:5.5"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.56-6.3 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.56 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.56:6.3" ;
    dho:textEn "They truly know and see with a mind that has developed the awakening factor of equanimity."@en ;
    dho:textPi "So upekkhāsambojjhaṅgaṁ bhāvitena cittena yathābhūtaṁ jānāti passati—"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.56/en/sujato#sn46.56:6.3"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.56-6.4 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.56 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.56:6.4" ;
    dho:textEn "This is a cause and reason for knowing and seeing."@en ;
    dho:textPi "ayampi kho, rājakumāra, hetu, ayaṁ paccayo ñāṇāya dassanāya."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.56/en/sujato#sn46.56:6.4"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.57-1.2 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.57 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.57:1.2" ;
    dho:textEn "“Mendicants, when the perception of a skeleton is developed and cultivated it’s very fruitful and beneficial."@en ;
    dho:textPi "“Aṭṭhikasaññā, bhikkhave, bhāvitā bahulīkatā mahapphalā hoti mahānisaṁsā."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.57/en/sujato#sn46.57:1.2"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.57-1.6 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.57 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.57:1.6" ;
    dho:textEn "That’s how the perception of a skeleton, when developed and cultivated, is very fruitful and beneficial.”"@en ;
    dho:textPi "Evaṁ bhāvitā kho, bhikkhave, aṭṭhikasaññā evaṁ bahulīkatā mahapphalā hoti mahānisaṁsā”ti."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.57/en/sujato#sn46.57:1.6"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.57-2.3 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.57 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.57:2.3" ;
    dho:textPi "Idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhu aṭṭhikasaññāsahagataṁ satisambojjhaṅgaṁ bhāveti …pe…"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.57/en/sujato#sn46.57:2.3"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.57-3.1 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.57 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.57:3.1" ;
    dho:textEn "“Mendicants, when the perception of a skeleton is developed and cultivated it leads to great benefit."@en ;
    dho:textPi "“Aṭṭhikasaññā, bhikkhave, bhāvitā bahulīkatā mahato atthāya saṁvattati."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.57/en/sujato#sn46.57:3.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.57-3.3 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.57 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.57:3.3" ;
    dho:textPi "Idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhu aṭṭhikasaññāsahagataṁ satisambojjhaṅgaṁ bhāveti …pe…"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.57/en/sujato#sn46.57:3.3"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.57-3.5 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.57 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.57:3.5" ;
    dho:textPi "Evaṁ bhāvitā kho, bhikkhave, aṭṭhikasaññā evaṁ bahulīkatā mahato atthāya saṁvattatī”ti."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.57/en/sujato#sn46.57:3.5"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.57-4.1 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.57 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.57:4.1" ;
    dho:textEn "“Mendicants, when the perception of a skeleton is developed and cultivated it leads to great sanctuary from the yoke."@en ;
    dho:textPi "“Aṭṭhikasaññā, bhikkhave, bhāvitā bahulīkatā mahato yogakkhemāya saṁvattati."@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.57/en/sujato#sn46.57:4.1"^^xsd:anyURI .

dho:p-sn46.57-4.3 a dho:Passage ;
    dho:inText dho:t-sn46.57 ;
    dho:segment "sn46.57:4.3" ;
    dho:textPi "Idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhu aṭṭhikasaññāsahagataṁ satisambojjhaṅgaṁ bhāveti …pe…"@pi ;
    dho:url "https://suttacentral.net/sn46.57/en/sujato#sn46.57:4.3"^^xsd:anyURI .

