    rdfs:comment "One statement from SN 46.53: when the mind is in STATE, it is the right/wrong time to develop FACTOR."@en .

dho:ExpandedAbbreviation a dho:SupportKind ;
    rdfs:label "expanded abbreviation"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The Pali of every cited segment is abbreviated (…pe…). The claim rests on the conventional expansion from the full sutta of the series, as the translation fills it in, not on words the text itself gives (D14, D19)."@en .

